{"doc_id":"MN2594-018-02","file":"LINKS_MN2594-018-02.tsv","header":["src_doc","src_page","text","n","kind","target_doc","target_page","target_page_end","target_pin","target_quote","status","by","note"],"rows":[{"src_doc":"MN2594-018-02","src_page":"1","text":"Reply at 4","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"MN2594-016","target_page":"4","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"at 4","status":"mapped","target_quote":"The words that Kirchner provided to the Court in quotations (\"under the direction\" and \"aid and assist in the prosecution\") do not appear anywhere in Minn. Stat. § 8.06.","line":2,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN2594-018-02-1-1-1-c16a482c","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":4,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"MN2594-018-02","src_page":"1","text":"Minn. Stat. § 8.06","n":"1","kind":"statute","target_doc":"MN-Stat-ch-8","target_page":"3","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"§ 8.06","status":"mapped","target_quote":"When requested by the attorney general, it shall be the duty of any county attorney of the state to appear within the county and act as attorney for any such board, commission, or officer in any court of such county.","line":3,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN2594-018-02-1-1-1-870c778e","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"MN2594-018-02","src_page":"1","text":"Complaint ¶¶ 24, 39, and 41","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"MN2594-001","target_page":"11","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"¶ 24","status":"mapped","target_quote":"Section 8.06 establishes that county attorneys act \"under the direction of the attorney general,\" meaning authority flows from the AG to county attorneys — not the reverse.","line":4,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN2594-018-02-1-1-1-3d4cdb96","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":11,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN2594-018-02","src_page":"1","text":"Complaint ¶¶ 24, 39, and 41","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"MN2594-001","target_page":"18","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"¶ 39","status":"mapped","target_quote":"County attorneys act \"under the direction of the attorney general\" and \"shall, when requested by the attorney general... aid and assist in the prosecution,\"","line":5,"k":2,"unit_id":"MN2594-018-02-1-1-2-3d4cdb96","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":18,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN2594-018-02","src_page":"1","text":"Complaint ¶¶ 24, 39, and 41","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"MN2594-001","target_page":"18","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"¶ 41","status":"mapped","target_quote":"","line":6,"k":3,"unit_id":"MN2594-018-02-1-1-3-3d4cdb96","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":null,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":18,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN2594-018-02","src_page":"1","text":"Section 8.06","n":"1","kind":"statute","target_doc":"MN-Stat-ch-8","target_page":"3","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"§ 8.06","status":"mapped","target_quote":"When requested by the attorney general, it shall be the duty of any county attorney of the state to appear within the county and act as attorney for any such board, commission, or officer in any court of such county.","line":7,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN2594-018-02-1-1-1-a195e3da","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"MN2594-018-02","src_page":"1","text":"¶ 40","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"MN2594-001","target_page":"18","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"¶ 40","status":"mapped","target_quote":"Minnesota Statutes Section 388.051 grants county attorneys \"original jurisdiction\" over criminal matters.","line":8,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN2594-018-02-1-1-1-53f9fd61","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":18,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN2594-018-02","src_page":"1","text":"Section 388.051","n":"1","kind":"statute","target_doc":"MN-Stat-388.051","target_page":"1","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"§ 388.051","status":"mapped","target_quote":"The county attorney shall: … (3) prosecute felonies, including the drawing of indictments found by the grand jury, and, to the extent prescribed by law, gross misdemeanors, misdemeanors, petty misdemeanors, and violations of municipal ordinances, charter provisions and rules or regulations","line":9,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN2594-018-02-1-1-1-805110a0","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"MN2594-018-02","src_page":"1","text":"Section 8.31, subdivision 2","n":"1","kind":"statute","target_doc":"MN-Stat-ch-8","target_page":"8","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"§ 8.31, subd. 2","status":"mapped","target_quote":"the attorney general shall have power to investigate those violations, or suspected violations, and to take such steps as are necessary to cause the arrest and prosecution of all persons violating any of the statutes specifically mentioned in subdivision 1","line":10,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN2594-018-02-1-1-1-59d9028a","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":8,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"MN2594-018-02","src_page":"1","text":"¶ 36","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"MN2594-001","target_page":"16","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"¶ 36","status":"mapped","target_quote":"for the violation of any such law","line":11,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN2594-018-02-1-1-1-a738cf4a","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":16,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN2594-018-02","src_page":"2","text":"Exhibit B","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"MN2594-001-03","target_page":"1","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"","status":"mapped","target_quote":"","line":12,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN2594-018-02-2-1-1-526cbef4","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":null,"src_pdf_page":2,"target_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN2594-018-02","src_page":"2","text":"Ala. Code § 36-15-21","n":"1","kind":"statute","target_doc":"MN2594-001-03","target_page":"8","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"Ex. B at 8 (Ala. Code § 36-15-21)","status":"mapped","target_quote":"Alabama's § 36-15-21 vests all state litigation \"under the direction and control\" of the AG","line":13,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN2594-018-02-2-1-1-b6b733a5","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":2,"target_pdf_page":8,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN2594-018-02","src_page":"2","text":"Ex. B at 8","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"MN2594-001-03","target_page":"8","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"at 8","status":"mapped","target_quote":"Alabama's § 36-15-21 vests all state litigation \"under the direction and control\" of the AG","line":14,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN2594-018-02-2-1-1-bf67f806","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":2,"target_pdf_page":8,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":n